# Variadic fn whose body calls variant-payload with the collected named args as payload.
# This mimics the ADT constructor pattern: [fn [...payload] [variant-payload "Tag" payload]]
# called with named args should create a variant with dict payload.
[f: [fn [let ...payload] [variant-payload "Box" payload]]
 result: [f value: 42]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(payload), "result": Variant(Box, Dict({"value": Int(42)}))})
